Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.62,0:00:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,But I don't want to give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.64,0:00:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,In the cracks in the bottom of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.70,0:00:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I have been born in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.44,0:00:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I will surely find this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.56,0:00:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I will change the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.18,0:00:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I will change the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.76,0:00:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.16,0:01:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Fighting God!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.24,0:01:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,recent directive now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.34,0:02:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Here it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.26,0:02:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,After the initial greeting, it\Nsays he input the information
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.70,0:02:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,onto this disk when we\Nboarded the train in Napoli.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.18,0:02:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It goes on, saying,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.58,0:02:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I therefore have no means of knowing the
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.32,0:02:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,number of your pursuers\Nat the present moment,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.54,0:02:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,nor do I know the number
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.72,0:02:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,of men you have possibly lost\Nin your battles until now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.42,0:02:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,This disk will tell you the best
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.06,0:02:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,way for us to safely\Nrendezvous with my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.72,0:02:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It will be your final mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.76,0:02:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Also know this,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.04,0:02:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,it is absolutely imperative that you\Nfollow my instructions to the letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.92,0:02:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,This condition
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.54,0:02:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,is non-negotiable.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.78,0:02:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,If you or your men deviate from my\Ndirective, regardless of whether the
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.30,0:02:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,act is accidental, I'll be forced to\Nconsider it an overt act of betrayal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.42,0:02:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,And now for my directive.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.96,0:02:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You are to travel to the\Nisland of San Giorgiorno Major.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.30,0:02:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,There, with my daughter in tow, you\Nshall go to the top of the bell tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.36,0:03:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Upon your safe delivery of my child,\Nyou will have completed the mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.48,0:03:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Rule number one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.86,0:03:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no stairway to the top,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.66,0:03:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,and only one elevator can reach\Nthe peak of the bell tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.48,0:03:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Only Trish and one protector shall\Nbe allowed to board that elevator.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.70,0:03:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Rule 2.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.98,0:03:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Said protector must have no knives, guns,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.72,0:03:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,or cell phones, or any\Nother objects on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.92,0:03:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Rule 3.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.14,0:03:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,From the moment you retrieve this disc,\Nyou will have 15 minutes to disembark.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.96,0:03:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,This disc is outfitted with a transmitter,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.64,0:03:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,which will allow me to\Nfollow your movements.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.24,0:03:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Rule 4.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.52,0:03:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The others must remain on the boat\Nand are forbidden from coming ashore.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.92,0:03:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That is all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.40,0:03:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We've made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.56,0:03:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.66,0:03:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,So the boss is at the\Ntop of that tower, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.52,0:03:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, he's certainly detailed\Nand extremely careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.96,0:03:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But given that he's the head of the\Nentire organization, makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.12,0:04:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's strange knowing that this\Nwill be the end of our mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.56,0:04:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But we're alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.10,0:04:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Couldn't ask for more than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.86,0:04:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we're alive all\Nright, but just barely.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.02,0:04:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We made it to the City of Water.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.82,0:04:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We should have some fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.00,0:04:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,This place has great cuisine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.44,0:04:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,They've got good chow here, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.42,0:04:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't realize how hungry I\Nwas, but my tummy's rumbling.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.40,0:04:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So what are the local specialties?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.28,0:04:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,They've got squid ink pasta\Nand horsehair crab salad,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.50,0:04:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Not to mention the carpaccio\Nthat's served at the Hotel Capri.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.02,0:04:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's to die for.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.06,0:04:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you lost it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.16,0:04:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,In case you've forgotten,\Nwe are still on assignment!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.62,0:04:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Narancia, keep an eye\Non the radar. Uh, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.92,0:04:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucciaratti, I would like to offer\Nmyself up to be Trisha's guardian.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.58,0:04:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.78,0:04:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me go with her to the bell tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.78,0:04:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Just who the hell do\Nyou think you are, kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.74,0:04:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Uchirati's our Cape, so he's taking\Nher to the boss, arrogant prick.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.38,0:04:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The boss would have designated someone to
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.48,0:04:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,do it himself if he knew\Nwho was still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.30,0:04:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, but I must go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.36,0:05:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's move, Trish.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.98,0:05:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Two were requested, and two it shall be.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.00,0:05:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.14,0:05:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Our chance to learn the boss's identity.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.58,0:05:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let it slip by.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.18,0:05:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, Giorno.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.48,0:05:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Given that this is our last mission,\Nmind lending me a little bit of luck?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.28,0:05:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Some see them as children of the\Nsun, others as symbols of life.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.42,0:05:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like a talisman, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.46,0:05:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess so. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.86,0:05:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Ladybugs are bringers of good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.42,0:05:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,This brooch is pulsating with\Nlife thanks to Golden Wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.08,0:05:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It will serve as our beacon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.82,0:05:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucciarati.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.28,0:05:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Fugo?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.84,0:05:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,This seems the most\Nfitting time to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.96,0:05:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Why so formal?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.42,0:06:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Thing is, I always knew that you\Nwere destined to become Cape.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.40,0:06:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I also know you'll see this\Nmission through to the very end.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.52,0:06:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, of course he will.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.92,0:06:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Together, I know we'll rise\Nall the way to the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.12,0:06:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that we will.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.58,0:06:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The time's come. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.52,0:06:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as I can find a way\Nto affix this to the boss,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.08,0:06:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno will be able to\Ntrack his every move.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.32,0:06:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We will unveil the boss's identity.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.20,0:06:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.50,0:07:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,He left the door open.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.90,0:07:34.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Our options are the\Nground floor or the tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.28,0:07:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Straight shot and nowhere to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.92,0:07:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What is...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.83,0:07:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,what is going to happen to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.42,0:07:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,First, I'm kidnapped\Nby a bunch of mafiosi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.40,0:07:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,My life is threatened.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.78,0:07:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, to top it off, now I'm being\Ndragged off to a father I've never met.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.70,0:07:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,So, where am I supposed to go from here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.44,0:08:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,No need to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.20,0:08:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Your safety is the boss's concern.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.96,0:08:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,As for your path moving forward, I\Nbelieve I can offer some insight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.14,0:08:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be given a different name, after\Nwhich you may need to alter your appearance.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.54,0:08:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,And you'll likely assume a new identity.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.42,0:08:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll reside somewhere far away from us,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.82,0:08:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,but at long last, you'll\Ntruly know happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.32,0:08:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I assure you, Trish, your\Nfather can make that happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.16,0:08:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, take my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.06,0:08:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.97,0:08:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.96,0:08:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Not in the slightest.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.16,0:09:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if I'll one day\Ngrow to love my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.82,0:09:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Those aren't the kinds of\Nthings families worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.98,0:09:23.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.89,0:09:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What was I thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.12,0:09:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's strange to worry my\Nhead over things like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.94,0:09:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,We're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.04,0:09:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.58,0:09:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Trish! Trish!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.38,0:09:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.88,0:09:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Her hand? But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.86,0:09:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,When did...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.90,0:10:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We're supposed to be the only\Nones currently in this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.96,0:10:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The only people who even\Nknow about this are my
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.72,0:10:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,team and there's no way\Ncould the boss have really
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.14,0:10:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Was this to protect his identity this\Nmission all the agony we've been through
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.66,0:10:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,what the hell Was it for did he only lure\Nus all here to kill her with his own hands
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.64,0:10:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Bruno Bucciarati was born the son of a\Nfisherman in a small town outside Napoli.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.48,0:10:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Often labeled as standoffish, Bruno's\Nfather lived a life of integrity.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.38,0:10:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,More than anything, he fought to protect\Nhis family from life's cruelties.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.32,0:10:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm back, Bruno. Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.22,0:10:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The net needs mending.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.74,0:10:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.40,0:11:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Bruno's mother had a kind heart, and their\Nfrequent chats always warmed his soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.46,0:11:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,He especially looked forward\Nto her nightly bedtime stories.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.76,0:11:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, time for bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.94,0:11:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,However, everything changed when\NBucciarati was seven. What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.44,0:11:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.82,0:11:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know, but this can't go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.42,0:11:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to leave and find my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.82,0:11:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,After ten years of marriage,\Nhis parents divorced.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.70,0:11:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,No one except his parents would ever know\Nthe reason why their relationship ended.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.30,0:11:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,And Bruno?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.60,0:11:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'll he stay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.76,0:11:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The one thing his parents\Nagreed on was that the
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.82,0:11:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,decision of where he would\Nlive was Bruno's to make.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.70,0:11:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Bruno, I want you to know Mama and\NPapa love you more than anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.42,0:11:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,But we think it's best we live apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.00,0:11:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, my baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.70,0:11:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how it has to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.68,0:11:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,But we wanted to give you a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.80,0:11:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to come with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.44,0:11:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Or would you rather stay\Nand live here with Papa?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.10,0:12:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You've always been such a bright boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.34,0:12:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You could get a good education.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.92,0:12:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, and there'll be other\Nkids your age to play with.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.02,0:12:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to come and\Nlive with Mama, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.38,0:12:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.00,0:12:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, I think I'll\Nstay here with Papa. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.26,0:12:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't mean that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.54,0:12:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Bruno, don't make a rash decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.22,0:12:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You've always liked Mama best.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.38,0:12:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm staying here and keeping Papa company.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.28,0:12:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.38,0:12:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama will be alright no\Nmatter where she goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.60,0:12:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But Papa...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.26,0:12:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,This is goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.40,0:12:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise you, honey,\NI'll visit every month.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.98,0:12:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.86,0:12:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucciarati's instincts proved correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.18,0:12:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Two years after his mother's departure,\Nshe remarried a Milanese man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.12,0:13:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,After that, he would only\Nsee his mother at Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.94,0:13:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,All that had a curious\Neffect on her former husband,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.22,0:13:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,who became possessed with the idea\Nof sending his son to a good school.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.28,0:13:15.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Papa, shouldn't the\Ncustomers be arriving soon?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.22,0:13:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.38,0:13:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I lost track of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.08,0:13:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go ahead and recast the nets then.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.92,0:13:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.83,0:13:23.03,Default,,0,0,0,,This one's all yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.06,0:13:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Bruno's father had always\Nworked as a fisherman,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.40,0:13:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,but now that he was putting\Nhis son through school,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.24,0:13:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,he needed to use his boat to make money\Nwith tourists and visiting fishermen.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.16,0:13:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And so, the Wheel of\NDestiny steadily turned.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.50,0:13:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, signore.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.08,0:13:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That island isn't ideal for fishing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.14,0:13:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The other one...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.08,0:13:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't give a damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.42,0:13:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We want to go fishing\Nthere, so we're going to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.84,0:13:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Just shut up and do your\Nfreaking job, boat man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.72,0:13:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.60,0:13:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.04,0:13:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Later that evening,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.52,0:13:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,the Coast Guard would\Nfind Bucciarati's father,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.12,0:14:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,his body devastated with bullet wounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.32,0:14:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,GSWs to the arms, shoulders,\Nchest, and abdomen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.42,0:14:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Seven total.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.52,0:14:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The bullets are still in him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.82,0:14:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.20,0:14:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Please wait until the surgery is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.76,0:14:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Just try and calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.14,0:14:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Are there any family members we can call?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.96,0:14:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Papa.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.88,0:14:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,This is evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.30,0:14:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Make sure forensics gets it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.68,0:14:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Si, signore. I'm off. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.40,0:14:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,How could this have happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.56,0:14:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.78,0:14:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you his son?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.34,0:14:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We found this at the crime scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.86,0:14:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems your father became an\Naccidental witness to a drug deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.14,0:14:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,He was shot to ensure his silence.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.74,0:14:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Your father's a very important\Nwitness to this case,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.74,0:14:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,so trust me when I say we're all\Nrooting for him to pull through.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.10,0:14:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Drugs?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.01,0:14:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Drugs put my papa in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.52,0:15:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Miraculously, Bucciarati's\Nfather survived the surgery.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.50,0:15:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The seven bullets that tore through\Nhis flesh missed critical organs.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.76,0:15:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Those who found him were equipped\Nwith the necessary life-saving tools,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.38,0:15:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,buying him time to get to the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.02,0:15:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a true miracle.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.36,0:15:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,But as far as Bucciarati's\Nlife was concerned,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.52,0:15:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,it may have been better if his\Nfather hadn't survived at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.44,0:15:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Sometimes, life makes it impossible\Nto make the right choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.42,0:15:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Life gets messy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.92,0:15:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Lines get blurred.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.92,0:15:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn fisherman.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.22,0:15:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You just don't know when\Nto call it quits, do ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.78,0:15:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll keep watch, just hurry up and do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.44,0:15:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a pain for making\Nus make a night call.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.36,0:15:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Do us all a favor and die!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.70,0:15:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.68,0:15:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.04,0:15:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just some punk kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.26,0:16:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.62,0:16:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,He's just a kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.76,0:16:03.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Smash the damn knife away!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.22,0:16:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.42,0:16:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let them hurt you, Papa.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.96,0:16:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave it all to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.32,0:16:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You just worry about getting better.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.12,0:16:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,At age 12,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.62,0:16:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Bruno Bucciarati had become a murderer,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.12,0:16:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,and a murderer he would\Nremain the rest of his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.06,0:16:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't turn back now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.18,0:16:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Not when they want to\Npermanently shut us up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.72,0:16:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And I can't count on the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.04,0:16:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The only organization that could\Nprotect them ruled from the shadows.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.08,0:16:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The Family.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.20,0:16:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Ujarati knocked on its doors.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.96,0:16:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And in exchange for his service and\Nloyalty, protection was finally guaranteed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.28,0:17:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,He saw it as the embodiment of\Njustice and gave his all for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.80,0:17:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,He soon made a name for himself\Nand caught the eye of Cape Polpo.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.52,0:17:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Five years later, Bucciarati's father\Ndied from complications from his wounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.16,0:17:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucciarati despised the white\Npowder of greed that had brought
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.00,0:17:22.65,Default,,0,0,0,,them into this hell and swore\Nto battle it with all his might.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.96,0:17:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.22,0:17:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.46,0:17:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise I'll leave him alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.08,0:17:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never bother him again!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.62,0:17:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That'd be wise.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.88,0:17:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Regret is an emotion\Nfelt only by the living.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.28,0:17:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you're a mafioso...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.44,0:17:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What in the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.74,0:17:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.65,0:17:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What's in the bags?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.80,0:17:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Buterati realized that the\Nboss, his model of justice,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.10,0:17:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,profited from the drugs he so despised.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.28,0:17:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,This filth's being peddled in my city?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.66,0:17:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It was supposed to be prohibited!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.98,0:18:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Now the boss is our damn boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.38,0:18:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,His wretchedness makes me want to puke.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.22,0:18:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Abusing the weak and innocent\Nis just a means to an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.44,0:18:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Profiting from the pain and\Nsuffering of countless citizens?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.48,0:18:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.39,0:18:16.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You do it to your daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.66,0:18:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a fiendish monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.50,0:18:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a disgrace and\Nyou've let me down again,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.44,0:18:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,but you've done it for the last time!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.44,0:18:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,There, Trisha's still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.42,0:18:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Good, it's stuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.48,0:18:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,God's hope, I didn't see his face.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.86,0:18:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,At first, I was content with uncovering\Nyour identity, but everything's changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.60,0:18:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,After what you've done, die!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.48,0:18:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Think fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.52,0:18:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,,The boss still assumes that\NI'm absolutely loyal to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.00,0:19:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll die by assassination.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.36,0:19:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll ambush him as he tries to\Nescape and kill the bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.22,0:19:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, this is...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.92,0:19:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,this opening.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.12,0:19:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, the demented bastard\Nwould hide in the crypt of a church.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.24,0:19:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,He thinks he can murder\NTrish in complete anonymity.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.48,0:19:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,His plan must be to pass through the crypt\Nto escape the building on the other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.32,0:19:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm lying in wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.88,0:19:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.86,0:20:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,In position. Now leave\Nwhile you're still able.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.56,0:20:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucciarati step out from behind that\Npillar and lose your life in the process
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.64,0:20:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Go! Zippermen!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.06,0:20:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll rip it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.70,0:21:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Somehow, he figured out I was here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.08,0:21:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,But now, he's resorted to\Nhiding in the shadows again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.10,0:21:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to find his\Nweakness, whatever it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.82,0:21:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Your rationale intrigues me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.64,0:21:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Just what were you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.78,0:21:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I had a great deal of respect for your
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.40,0:21:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,excellence and devotion\Nto the mission until now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.10,0:21:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Was your judgment clouded\Nby your promotion to Cape?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.02,0:21:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Or did your hubris\Nseduce you into thinking
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.04,0:21:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,you had the power and\Nability to overtake me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.10,0:21:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Once Trish regains consciousness, I'll be\Nsure to let her know you never existed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.90,0:21:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Trish, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.40,0:21:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Why bring her into this dispute?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.94,0:21:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,My daughter is of no concern\Nto you and your ilk demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.04,0:21:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You could never understand\Nwhat's in my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.16,0:21:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Giorno.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.54,0:21:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,We're on it, Bucciarati.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.34,0:21:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Tracking down his movements as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.62,0:21:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The brooch will tell me exactly\Nwhere he is at all times.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.88,0:22:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now, he's at the bottom\Nof the stairs to the crypt.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.76,0:22:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,He's next to the pillar, about\Ntwo meters away from the stairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.00,0:22:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But wait, Bucciarati! Something's wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.70,0:22:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Until we know what it is, don't attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.70,0:22:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,End him!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.30,0:22:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Zipperman!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.56,0:22:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't him hiding\Nin the pillar's shadow.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.88,0:22:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It was me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.90,0:22:35.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.81,0:22:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,what the...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.88,0:22:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.82,0:22:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Think of this as a gift, a\Nfarewell gift from the heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.40,0:22:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,In a moment, you will cease to exist,\Nso I will allow you to know now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.36,0:22:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What you witnessed and felt\Nwas your future self laid bare.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.24,0:22:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Simply put, your past\Nself saw a future version.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.14,0:23:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Now behold, know the almighty\Npower of Emperor Crimson.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.92,0:23:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I obliterated time, then leapt beyond it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.32,0:23:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter who it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.74,0:23:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall never allow any Cretan to\Nthreaten my eternal transcendence.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.02,0:23:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Not ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.54,0:23:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The time's come for you to fade away.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.66,0:23:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Mucharate, your mission as\Nprotector has been terminated.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.34,0:23:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Now may the fires of hell embrace you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.42,0:23:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
